   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MindMap · Status · Findings, as live (j01 waits on the data owner); every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\n🙋 Interaction is every view's last section and holds its own forms; the right rail: Report · Work · Studio · Interactions · Delivery · Skills · Files (no Timeline on a Job), as served 261108",
   "originalText": "MindMap · Status · Findings, as live (j01 waits on the data owner); every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\n🙋 Interaction is every view's last section and holds its own forms; the right rail: Report · Work · Studio · Interactions · Delivery · Skills · Files (no Timeline on a Job), as served 261108",
